WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.883 --> 00:00:03.800
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> <b>Have you been</b> to that new Mexican restaurant?

2
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:05.741
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> Yes, I <b>have</b>.

3
00:00:06.466 --> 00:00:07.950
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> When <b>did you go</b> there?

4
00:00:08.083 --> 00:00:10.600
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> I <b>went</b> last weekend.

5
00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:12.599
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> Who <b>did you go</b> with?

6
00:00:12.683 --> 00:00:15.666
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> I <b>went</b> with some people from work.